{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "18c1a193-ee24-80cc-92cb-49466aad88f3",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T12:38:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, pardon me, good afternoon. I'm calling about a sidewalk that's in bad shape. Am I in the right place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are. Sidewalks and roads, we handle both. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 202 Ruggles Avenue. Right out front of the house, on the Historic Hill side. Pardon me, can you hear me all right? I'm on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Two-oh-two Ruggles. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:35:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One of the slabs has heaved up. The edge is maybe two inches higher than the next one. I tripped on it Wednesday morning. I caught myself, so I wasn't hurt, but it's a hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, glad you didn't go down. Is that the city sidewalk, out by the curb line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, the public walk. Not on my property. It looks like a tree root pushed it up from underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a request so somebody can come out and look at it. They'll assess whether it needs to be ground down or replaced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Pardon me, one more question. My car has been parking along there too. If something happened to the car on a bad stretch like that, does the city reimburse for damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a claims question. Generally you'd file a written claim with the city and it gets reviewed. I can't tell you how it would come out. I can give you the number to the city clerk's office if you want to ask about the process."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. I'm not filing anything right now, I only wanted to know if it's possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me finish this request first. Can I get the best callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, zero-one-seven-one. Anything else about the spot I should note? Anybody who walks there regularly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my child walks that way on Tuesdays to an after-school art class, so it gets used. Pardon me, I'd like it noted that it's a school-age kid going by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, I'll note that it's a regular walking route for kids. Alright, you're all set. I'm giving you a reference number, do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's PW, two, six, zero, two, two, zero, one, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, two six zero two two zero one four. Pardon me, let me read that back to be sure. Yes, that's what I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Hang onto it if you call to check on the status."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you very much, Denise. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Fiore. Bye now."
    }
  ],
